                <note rend="inline" type="source">815.00/4278a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Honduras</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Summerlin</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-10-27T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">October 27,
                                1928—5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>95. Your 125, October 26 noon. Navy Department states USS <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Cleveland</hi> will remain Puerto Cortes for additional period. Cable your
                    opinion regarding earliest practicable day upon which vessel should depart.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
